<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <p>We're a team of pet lovers dedicated to bringing you the best for your furry family members.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container page-content">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div>
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>Paws &amp; Claws was founded by pet owners who were frustrated with the lack of quality, thoughtfully-curated pet products in one place. We set out to build a store we'd actually want to shop at — one that puts pets first.</p>
      <p>Every product we carry is carefully selected with your pet's safety, comfort, and happiness in mind. We work with trusted brands and manufacturers who share our commitment to quality.</p>
      <p>From cozy beds and nutritious food to fun toys and stylish accessories, we have everything your dog or cat needs to live their best life.</p>

      <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem; margin-top: var(--spacing-md);">
        <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/dogs" class="btn btn-primary">Shop Dogs</a>
        <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/cats" class="btn btn-outline">Shop Cats</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      {%- if page.image -%}
        <img src="{{ page.image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ page.title | escape }}" width="700" height="500" loading="lazy">
      {%- else -%}
        <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-secondary) 100%); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); min-height:350px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:6rem;">🐾</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- if page.content != blank -%}
    <div style="max-width:800px; margin: var(--spacing-lg) auto 0; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8;">
      {{ page.content }}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <!-- Values section -->
  <div style="margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);">
    <h2 class="text-center" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">Our Values</h2>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card__icon">🐾</div>
        <p class="why-card__title">Pet-First Always</p>
        <p class="why-card__desc">Every decision we make starts with one question: is this good for pets?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card__icon">✅</div>
        <p class="why-card__title">Quality Assured</p>
        <p class="why-card__desc">We test and vet every product before it reaches our shelves.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card__icon">🌿</div>
        <p class="why-card__title">Sustainable Choices</p>
        <p class="why-card__desc">We prioritize eco-friendly products and responsible packaging.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card__icon">💛</div>
        <p class="why-card__title">Community Driven</p>
        <p class="why-card__desc">A portion of every sale goes to local animal shelters.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
